{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On this monthly calendar, the date behind one of the letters is added to the date behind C.  If this sum equals the sum of the dates behind A and B, then the letter is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54ffff421c76ca2c5e63c918ddd6069e68ded4f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(12); draw((1,1)--(23,1)); draw((0,5)--(23,5)); draw((0,9)--(23,9)); draw((0,13)--(23,13)); for(int a=0; a&lt;6; ++a)  {   draw((4a+2,0)--(4a+2,14));  } label(&quot;Tues.&quot;,(4,14),N); label(&quot;Wed.&quot;,(8,14),N); label(&quot;Thurs.&quot;,(12,14),N); label(&quot;Fri.&quot;,(16,14),N); label(&quot;Sat.&quot;,(20,14),N); label(&quot;C&quot;,(12,10.3),N); label(&quot;$\\textbf{A}$&quot;,(16,10.3),N); label(&quot;Q&quot;,(12,6.3),N); label(&quot;S&quot;,(4,2.3),N); label(&quot;$\\textbf{B}$&quot;,(8,2.3),N); label(&quot;P&quot;,(12,2.3),N); label(&quot;T&quot;,(16,2.3),N); label(&quot;R&quot;,(20,2.3),N); [/asy]\" width=\"462\" height=\"305\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/1/c812a3623993d0c09c8078e38330f5d2eb8ad88d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{P} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{Q} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{R} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{S} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{T}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the date behind C is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than the date behind A, the date added to the date behind C should be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than the date behind B, which would be the date behind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/e/78e0e4b5c0d7fc89ab564dc4aa7d100fbeacf6b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{P}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"59\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the date behind C be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the date added to C. Then the date behind A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, while the date behind B is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79ce52086051b22234f4ad737210d55858521989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/4562abd517ef1f52fea38e958514cc7f46d4dec0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)+(x+13)=x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"211\" height=\"20\" />, and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/2/4327b3a12a37a13e1ddeb68cdd5950b2b4b9e0d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x+14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, which is the date behind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/e/78e0e4b5c0d7fc89ab564dc4aa7d100fbeacf6b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{P}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"59\" height=\"30\" />. \n</p><p>-motorfinn, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Proble